{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every backpack in the scene, it is positioned on the right side. To the left of the backpack is a pan that is smaller than it. Further left of the pan is a hat, and to the left of the hat is a shoe. There is a pair of scissors located on the bottom side that aligns vertically with the backpack. A pen aligns vertically with the pan. A spoon aligns vertically with the hat, and the pen is placed to the right of the spoon. Finally, a lighter aligns vertically with the shoe, and the shoe is larger than the lighter.",
